---
// Hero Component for Help Chat Bot
---

<section class="hero-section">
  <!-- Glowing background elements -->
  <div class="glow-effect" style="top: 10%; left: 10%; width: 400px; height: 400px;"></div>
  <div class="glow-effect" style="bottom: 10%; right: 5%; width: 500px; height: 500px; opacity: 0.12;"></div>

  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="meta-partner-badge">
        <span class="meta-dot"></span>
        <span>Utiliza API Oficial da Meta</span>
      </div>
      
      <h1>
        Organize seu atendimento com <span class="text-gradient">Automação Inteligente</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="hero-description">
        Somos especialistas em automação inteligente e queremos te ajudar a melhorar seu atendimento. Centralize e profissionalize seu WhatsApp e Instagram em um só lugar com estabilidade e total segurança contra banimentos.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="https://wa.me/5538998591036?text=Olá,%20vi%20o%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20organizar%20meu%20atendimento!" target="_blank" class="btn-whatsapp">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-whatsapp" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M13.601 2.326A7.85 7.85 0 0 0 7.994 0C3.627 0 .068 3.558.064 7.926c0 1.399.366 2.76 1.057 3.965L0 16l4.204-1.102a7.9 7.9 0 0 0 3.79.948h.008c4.368 0 7.927-3.559 7.931-7.928a7.9 7.9 0 0 0-2.332-5.593l-.004-.005zM7.994 14.52a6.57 6.57 0 0 1-3.356-.92l-.24-.144-2.494.654.666-2.433-.156-.251a6.56 6.56 0 0 1-1.007-3.505c0-3.626 2.957-6.584 6.591-6.584a6.56 6.56 0 0 1 4.66 1.931 6.56 6.56 0 0 1 1.928 4.66c-.004 3.639-2.961 6.592-6.592 6.592m3.69-4.29c-.2-.1-1.171-.578-1.349-.643-.178-.065-.307-.1-.439.1-.132.197-.508.643-.623.774-.115.13-.23.148-.43.048a5.9 5.9 0 0 1-1.602-1.012 6.2 6.2 0 0 1-1.109-1.397c-.12-.207-.013-.32.088-.42.09-.09.2-.234.3-.35.1-.117.133-.197.2-.33.067-.132.034-.249-.017-.35-.051-.1-.439-1.058-.6-.145-.158-.387-.343-.377-.49-.377-.113.001-.214.07-.306.182-.132.16-.395.428-.395.948 0 1.02.744 2.01 1.093 2.471.348.462 1.93 2.95 4.67 4.137.653.28 1.162.447 1.558.573.656.208 1.252.179 1.725.108.527-.078 1.17-.478 1.334-.94.164-.462.164-.858.115-.94-.049-.082-.18-.13-.38-.23"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Quero Automatizar Meu Negócio</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#beneficios" class="btn-secondary">
          <span>Ver Funcionalidades</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-indicators">
        <div class="avatar-group">
          <div class="avatar" style="background-color: #6C5DD3; color: #FFFFFF;">A</div>
          <div class="avatar" style="background-color: #029EF8; color: #FFFFFF;">L</div>
          <div class="avatar" style="background-color: #03AD3D; color: #FFFFFF;">M</div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-text">
          <strong>+50 Empresas</strong> já simplificaram o atendimento de saúde e comercial.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Phone Simulator Column -->
    <div class="hero-visual reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
      <div class="phone-frame">
        <div class="phone-notch"></div>
        <div class="phone-header">
          <div class="phone-header-info">
            <div class="avatar-clinic">
              <!-- Using logo directly in the avatar -->
              <img src="/logo.webp" alt="Help Chat Bot avatar" class="logo-avatar-img" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="clinic-name">Help Chat Bot</div>
              <div class="clinic-status">
                <span class="status-indicator"></span>
                <span>Online (API Oficial)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phone-actions">
            <span class="phone-action-icon">📞</span>
            <span class="phone-action-icon">⋮</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="phone-body" id="chatTimeline">
          <!-- Chat messages simulated with CSS animations -->
          <div class="chat-msg msg-user animate-msg-1">
            <p>Olá, gostaria de confirmar se meu exame está agendado para amanhã.</p>
            <span class="msg-time">13:45</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="chat-msg msg-bot animate-msg-2">
            <div class="typing-indicator">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="msg-content">
              <p>Olá! Sou o assistente inteligente da <strong>Help Chat Bot</strong>. Vou verificar para você. Qual o seu CPF ou nome completo?</p>
            </div>
            <span class="msg-time">13:45</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="chat-msg msg-user animate-msg-3">
            <p>Claro, meu nome é Mariana Silva dos Santos.</p>
            <span class="msg-time">13:46</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="chat-msg msg-bot animate-msg-4">
            <div class="msg-content">
              <p>Localizei Mariana! ✅ Seu exame de <strong>Ultrassonografia</strong> está agendado para amanhã, <strong>17/07 às 09:30h</strong> na Clínica Bem Estar.</p>
              <p>Você confirma seu comparecimento?</p>
              <div class="bot-buttons">
                <span class="bot-btn">Sim, confirmo</span>
                <span class="bot-btn">Não, preciso remarcar</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="msg-time">13:46</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="chat-msg msg-user animate-msg-5">
            <p>Sim, confirmo!</p>
            <span class="msg-time">13:46</span>
          </div>

          <div class="chat-msg msg-bot animate-msg-6">
            <div class="msg-content">
              <p>Maravilhoso! Sua presença foi confirmada e sua vaga foi otimizada no sistema. 🚀</p>
              <p>Obrigada por confirmar!</p>
            </div>
            <span class="msg-time">13:47</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="phone-footer">
          <span class="footer-emoji">⭐</span>
          <div class="footer-input">Mensagem</div>
          <span class="footer-mic">🎙️</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding-top: 160px;
    padding-bottom: 120px;
    background: radial-gradient(100% 100% at 50% 0%, rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.06) 0%, rgba(3, 7, 18, 0) 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .meta-partner-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.2);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .meta-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--color-secondary);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.5; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.5; }
  }

  .hero-content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-ctas .btn-whatsapp {
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .hero-ctas .btn-secondary {
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .trust-indicators {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .avatar-group {
    display: flex;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: -10px;
  }

  .avatar:first-child {
    margin-left: 0;
  }

  .trust-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .trust-text strong {
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  /* Phone Simulator styling with variables that adapt to light/dark themes */
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .phone-frame {
    /* Default dark variables for the phone */
    --phone-border: #1E293B;
    --phone-bg: #0F172A;
    --phone-header: #1E293B;
    --phone-body: #0B0F19;
    --phone-msg-bot: #1E293B;
    --phone-msg-bot-text: #E2E8F0;
    --phone-msg-time: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    --phone-btn-bg: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.1);
    --phone-btn-border: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.3);
    --phone-text-color: #FFFFFF;

    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    height: 600px;
    background: var(--phone-bg);
    border: 10px solid var(--phone-border);
    border-radius: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 50px rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.2);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* Light theme modifications for phone */
  html[data-theme="light"] .phone-frame {
    --phone-border: #CBD5E1;       /* Slate 300 */
    --phone-bg: #F8FAFC;           /* Slate 50 */
    --phone-header: #075E54;       /* WhatsApp Brand Green */
    --phone-body: #E5DDD5;         /* WhatsApp Light wallpaper */
    --phone-msg-bot: #FFFFFF;      /* White bubble */
    --phone-msg-bot-text: #334155; /* Slate 700 */
    --phone-msg-time: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    --phone-btn-bg: rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.05);
    --phone-btn-border: rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.2);
    --phone-text-color: #0F172A;
    
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.1), 0 0 40px rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.1);
  }

  .phone-notch {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 140px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--phone-border);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 18px;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 18px;
    z-index: 20;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .phone-header {
    background: var(--phone-header);
    padding: 24px 16px 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .phone-header-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .avatar-clinic {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .logo-avatar-img {
    width: 85%;
    height: 85%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .clinic-name {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .clinic-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .clinic-status {
    color: #00FF7F; /* Lighter green status on WhatsApp header */
  }

  .status-indicator {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .status-indicator {
    background-color: #00FF7F;
  }

  .phone-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .phone-body {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--phone-body);
    padding: 16px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* Chat Messages Simulator Logic */
  .chat-msg {
    max-width: 80%;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
    animation-fill-mode: forwards;
  }

  .chat-msg p {
    color: inherit;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .chat-msg p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .msg-time {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--phone-msg-time);
    display: block;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .msg-user {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    align-self: flex-end;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
    transform: translateX(20px);
  }

  /* Adjust user message in WhatsApp light mode to WhatsApp Green */
  html[data-theme="light"] .msg-user {
    background: #DCF8C6; /* Light green WhatsApp bubble */
    color: #303030;
  }

  .msg-bot {
    background: var(--phone-msg-bot);
    color: var(--phone-msg-bot-text);
    align-self: flex-start;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
    transform: translateX(-20px);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .bot-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .bot-btn {
    background: var(--phone-btn-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--phone-btn-border);
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .bot-btn {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  /* Phone Footer */
  .phone-footer {
    background: var(--phone-header);
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .footer-input {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--phone-bg);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .footer-input {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #475569;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .footer-emoji,
  html[data-theme="light"] .footer-mic {
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  /* Simulation Keyframes Timeline */
  @keyframes showMsg {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(0.95); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }

  .animate-msg-1 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 1s forwards; }
  .animate-msg-2 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 2.5s forwards; }
  .animate-msg-3 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 5s forwards; }
  .animate-msg-4 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 6.5s forwards; }
  .animate-msg-5 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 9.5s forwards; }
  .animate-msg-6 { animation: showMsg 0.4s ease 11s forwards; }

  /* Loop simulator container resetting state recursively */
  #chatTimeline {
    animation: chatScroll 18s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes chatScroll {
    0%, 15% { transform: translateY(0); }
    16%, 33% { transform: translateY(0); }
    34%, 55% { transform: translateY(-40px); }
    56%, 75% { transform: translateY(-110px); }
    76%, 95% { transform: translateY(-240px); }
    96%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* Reset message opacities on loop */
  @keyframes pulseOpacity {
    0%, 5% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Typing Indicator */
  .typing-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: var(--phone-msg-bot);
    border-radius: 12px;
    width: fit-content;
    animation: fadeOutTyping 0.3s ease 2.3s forwards;
  }

  .typing-indicator span {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
    animation: bounce 1.4s infinite ease-in-out both;
  }

  .typing-indicator span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: -0.32s; }
  .typing-indicator span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -0.16s; }

  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 80%, 100% { transform: scale(0); }
    40% { transform: scale(1.0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeOutTyping {
    to { display: none; opacity: 0; height: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  }

  /* Responsive styling */
  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding-top: 120px;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }
    
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .meta-partner-badge {
      align-self: center;
    }

    .hero-ctas {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .trust-indicators {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .phone-frame {
      max-width: 340px;
      height: 520px;
    }
  }
</style>
